   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="imagewarehouse/HRC/0001411.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <note hand="#h02" place="top" type="editorial">8</note>
   <note hand="#h01" place="top" type="authorial">10</note>
   <lg type="stanza">
     <l>Now, trumpeter, for thy close,</l>
     <l>Vouchsafe a higher strain<lb/> than any yet;</l>
     <l>Sing to my Soul&#8212;renew its<lb/> languishing faith &amp; hope;</l>
    <l>Rouse up my slow belief&#8212;<lb/> give me some vision<lb/> of the future;</l>
    <l>Give me, for once, its prophecy<lb/> and joy!</l>
   </lg>
   <lg type="stanza">
    <l>O glad, exulting, culminating<lb/> song!</l>
    <l>A vigor more than earth's is<lb/> in thy notes!</l>
    <l>Marches of victory&#8212;man <choice><orig>dis-<lb/>enthrall'd</orig><reg>disenthrall'd<lb/></reg></choice>&#8212;the conqueror at<lb/> last!</l>
    <l>Hymns to the Universal God,<lb/> from universal Man&#8212;all<lb/> joy!</l>
   </lg>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="imagewarehouse/HRC/27%20bv2%20Now%20Trumpeter%20Back.jpg" type="verso"/>
